When migrating from
```
  type Foo {
    a -> int64;
  }
```

to
```
  type Foo {
    a -> int64;
    index on (.a);
  }
```

The user will be prompted with `did you create index on (.a) of object type 'default::Foo'? [y,n,l,c,b,s,q,?]`

